## ObjectType: Settlement Snapshot

Local operational object; source concept reference does not assert OWL equivalence.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| snapshot_id | Snapshot id | string | Stable unique source-row identifier. | snapshot_id |
| event_id | Event id | string | Explicit foreign-key association; blank creates no edge. | event_id |
| as_of_date | As of date | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoffs. | as_of_date |
| knowledge_date | Knowledge date | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoffs. | knowledge_date |
| delivery_ratio | Delivery ratio | decimal | Decimal source value; blank is unknown, not zero. Power kW, energy kWh, money CNY; see business contract. | delivery_ratio |
| revenue_cny | Revenue cny | decimal | Decimal source value; blank is unknown, not zero. Power kW, energy kWh, money CNY; see business contract. | revenue_cny |
| quality | Quality | string | Fictional business value with equivalent bilingual meaning. | quality |
| quality_code | Quality code | string | Stable English code; paired display field is localized. | quality_code |

